<title>SINGAPORE: SM Summit to place out 10 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>SM Summit to place out 10 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Music disc maker SM Summit Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday the Stock Exchange of Singapore had given it approval to place 10 million new ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the placement was expected to be around April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
